stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading
  Loading --> List: Deal tours arrive
  Loading --> Empty: No tours belong to this deal
  Loading --> Unavailable: Read fails
  List --> Loading: Refresh
  Empty --> Loading: Refresh
  Unavailable --> Loading: Retry
  List --> DetailLoading: Open a tour
  DetailLoading --> Detail: Same deal detail arrives
  DetailLoading --> NotAvailable: Tour hidden, missing or belongs elsewhere
  Detail --> DetailLoading: Open another tour
  NotAvailable --> DetailLoading: Retry
  List --> Editor: Start a tour
  Empty --> Editor: Start a tour
  Detail --> Editor: Edit shortlist, route and packet
  Editor --> BoundTour: Save with immutable deal subject
  Loading --> Closed: Leave workspace
  DetailLoading --> Closed: Leave workspace
  Detail --> Unavailable: Session changes
  List --> Unavailable: Session changes
  Closed --> Closed: Ignore late reads
  %% never Show another deal's tours or detail
  %% never Let a late read repaint a closed workspace
  %% never Show server errors as tour content
